'''Theatre (Trio) Speed-Chaser''' is a [[Combat Achievements/Master|master combat achievement]] which requires the player to complete the [[Theatre of Blood]] in a team of three players in less than 20 minutes.

Unlike [[Tombs of Amascut]], speed-based achievements for the Theatre of Blood count the challenge time rather than the overall time.

